OL,3,GNEWSA'We just want to get home' -
OL,4,Adozens stranded in Tunisia after
OL,5,Acancelled Belfast flight
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of people from Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fhave been left stranded in Tunisia
OL,9,Fafter their EasyJet flight home was
OL,10,Fcancelled, with the airline telling
OL,11,Fthem it had no other flights available
OL,12,Ffor another 10 days.
OL,14,FOne man told BBC News NI he has spent
OL,15,F#4,000 on travel home for his
OL,16,Ffamily-of-five, while another woman,
OL,17,FGeorgina Doherty, said her and her six
OL,18,Fchildren were trying to get home after
OL,19,Fthe death of her mother-in-law.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
