OL,3,GNEWSA'We just want to get home' -
OL,4,Adozens stranded in Tunisia after
OL,5,Acancelled Belfast flight
OL,6,
OL,7,FOthers described running out of
OL,8,Fmedication for health issues, while
OL,9,FEasyJet were also criticised over a
OL,10,Flack of support and communication.
OL,12,FEasyJet has said it is operating an
OL,13,Fadditional direct flight to Belfast on
OL,14,FTuesday night, and that it was "very
OL,15,Fsorry" for the inconvenience.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
